{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy to .clasp.json (gitignored) and set scriptId.",
    "",
    "scriptId is in the Apps Script editor URL:",
    "  script.google.com/home/projects/<SCRIPT_ID>/edit",
    "or Project Settings -> IDs -> Script ID.",
    "",
    "rootDir must stay 'apps-script' — that folder holds the .gs files AND",
    "appsscript.json, which clasp requires as the manifest.",
    "",
    "One .clasp.json per region. To run both, keep two files (.clasp.us.json,",
    ".clasp.eu.json) and copy the one you want over .clasp.json before pushing."
  ],
  "scriptId": "PASTE_YOUR_SCRIPT_ID_HERE",
  "rootDir": "apps-script"
}
